  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following data</p><p>Heat of combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>241</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Heat of combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Heat of combustion of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1234</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The heat of formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (Nearest integer).</p>",
